{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“咦？我忘了跟你说考试期间不用做便当没关系吗？”", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 185, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这是爱理的便当。”", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 187, "voice": "sk0352", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“感谢你教我念书的谢礼。我觉得考得还不错。”", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 187, "voice": "sk0353", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……这样啊。”", "text_idx": 164, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 185, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“再一下……再一下下啊熊喵小姐……”", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 183, "voice": "ag0282", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜～噜～”", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 189, "voice": "pn0060", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……为什么都特地出来转换心情了，还必须看到那只动物呢？”", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 190, "voice": "ar0550", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没问题的，因为小熊喵是疗愈系的。”", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": "mu0182", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“太放松反而危险吧……还必须再绷紧神经一下啊。”", "text_idx": 170, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 190, "voice": "ar0551", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“先不说那个，全部结束后，大家要不要聚一起庆祝一下？”", "text_idx": 165, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 185, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“听起来很棒呢！对未来抱有希望了！”", "text_idx": 167, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 183, "voice": "ag0283", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好了，该回教室了。”", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 190, "voice": "ar0552", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──于是。", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好，这样就全部结束了。”", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 181, "voice": "mc0087", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "汎用", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“辛苦了～～～！”", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "全班同学", "alt_speaker_idx": 182, "voice": "go040", "char_id": "汎用"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "４天来虽然辛苦但也热闹，时间一下子就过去了。", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
